# Epidemiological Trend Forecasting & Visual Analytics

An end-to-end time-series analytics and short-term forecasting pipeline built to track epidemiological progression across confirmed, recovered, and active case records—combining daily incidence rate engineering, rolling average smoothing, interactive visual analytics, and **Facebook Prophet** 7-day forward projections.

## Analytical Pipeline Flow

```text
Raw Epidemiological Records (CSV / Excel Time-Series Data)
        │
        ▼
Data Cleaning & Datetime Standardization (pd.to_datetime -> Chronological Sorting)
        │
        ▼
Feature & Rate Engineering
(Active Cases = Confirmed - Recovered - Deaths | Daily Incidence via .diff() | 7-Day Rolling Mean)
        │
        ├───────────────────────────────────────────┐
        ▼                                           ▼
Interactive Trend Visualization             Facebook Prophet Forecasting
(Plotly & Matplotlib Growth Curves)         (ds / y Formatting -> 7-Day Future Horizon)
                                                    │
                                                    ▼
                                    Predicted Trajectory & Uncertainty Intervals (yhat, yhat_lower, yhat_upper)
```

## Key Technical Highlights
- **Time-Series Aggregation & Rate Calculation:** Standardized multi-region daily case logs into chronological time-series pipelines, computing net active case loads, day-over-day new case velocity using `.diff()`, and 7-day rolling averages to smooth reporting noise.
- **Interactive Visual Analytics:** Built interactive time-series growth curves and comparative regional trajectories using **Plotly** and **Matplotlib** to highlight inflection points and peak transmission windows.
- **Additive Time-Series Forecasting with Prophet:** Formatted historical case series into Prophet's `ds` (datestamp) and `y` (target metric) schema to generate **7-day forward projections** complete with upper and lower confidence intervals (`yhat_lower`, `yhat_upper`) and trend/weekly seasonality decomposition plots.

## Tech Stack
- **Data Manipulation & Time-Series Processing:** Python, Pandas, NumPy
- **Forecasting Engine:** Facebook Prophet (`prophet`)
- **Data Visualization:** Plotly, Matplotlib

## Setup & Execution
1. Install dependencies:
   ```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```
2. Open the Jupyter Notebook in this repository (or launch in Google Colab) and run all cells sequentially to reproduce the rate calculations, interactive charts, and 7-day Prophet forecast diagnostics.
